        "text": "=You are a predictive business forecasting expert.\n\nGenerate forward-looking business forecasts.\n\nDepartment:\n{{ $json.normalizedQuery.normalizedDepartment }}\n\nMetrics:\n{{ $json.normalizedQuery.normalizedMetrics.join(\", \") }}\n\nForecast Window:\n{{ $json.normalizedQuery.analyticsWindowDays }} days\n\nFocus on:\n- expected growth\n- operational risks\n- future opportunities\n- performance trajectory\n- likely business outcomes\n\nProvide concise executive forecasting insights.",
