        "text": "=You are a professional enterprise business report writer.\n\nGenerate a complete executive business analytics report in professional HTML format.\n\nThe report must include:\n\n# Executive Summary\n\n# KPI Dashboard\n\n# Business Insights\n\n# Forecast Outlook\n\n# Strategic Recommendations\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Use clean HTML structure\n- Use professional executive layout\n- Include KPI cards\n- Include modern business tables\n- Use inline CSS styling\n- Make the layout suitable for email and PDF rendering\n- Use dark professional headers\n- Use readable fonts and spacing\n- Keep the report executive-level and concise\n\nNARRATIVE CONTEXT:\n{{ $('AI INPUT ANALYZER').item.json.text || '' }}\n\nKPI ANALYSIS:\n{{ $('KPI ANALYZER').item.json.text || '' }}\n\nFORECAST DATA:\n{{ $('DATA FORECASTING ENGINE').item.json.text || '' }}\n\nREQUESTER:\n{{ $json.queryConfig?.requesterName || '' }}\n\nDEPARTMENT:\n{{ $json.queryConfig?.department || '' }}\n\nDATE RANGE:\n{{ $json.queryConfig?.dateFrom || '' }}\nto\n{{ $json.queryConfig?.dateTo || '' }}\n\nGenerate complete HTML only.",
